From 808c1583b86bddc710049d503a88ed9ec09aef1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:50:19 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Tasks: only admin grades; parents upload answers and see the
 grade

- PUT/DELETE /api/tasks/:id/ratings/:childId are admin-only (parents and trainers can't grade).
- Parent is notified when the admin grades (new notification type task_rated).
- Parent task page: status (not done / under review / graded), answer upload, read-only grade
  and admin comment.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
